+# core/data/parts/hat/hats_b.txt - hats, second batch (CR4 A6): gene list `hat` values 36..63.
+# Hand-written part scripts on the family grammar of family_a.txt (crown, brim, band, bow, ring, chain,
+# frill, pouch). Anchor head, `scale 128`: y -128 is the top of the head, x +-128 its sides, y +10 the
+# eyes, so a crown is based at about -88 and a brim sits at its foot. The hat colour is the hat_color
+# row, the accessory colour a trim. Every hat is a plain cartoon garment or a joke prop: no tobacco, no
+# drug props, no real-world symbols, nothing on a minor beyond a hat.
+
+def hb_cb CK CY CW CH BK BW BH
+  mat hat_color
+  shade ball
+  solid
+  brim $BK 0 $CY $BW $BH
+  solid
+  crown $CK 0 $CY $CW $CH
+enddef
+
+def hb_band Y W H
+  mat hat_color dark
+  band 0 $Y $W $H
+enddef
+
+def hb_ball X Y R
+  mat accessory_color
+  shade ball
+  solid nocast
+  ellipse $X $Y $R $R
+enddef
+
+def hb_bow X Y S
+  mat accessory_color
+  shade ball
+  solid
+  bow $X $Y $S
+enddef
