+# CR4 A6: the hats and glasses batch in the creator's picture grid: the Outfit tab's Hat row (28 new hats) and the
+# Glasses row (27 new pairs). A new Hellvile citizen: the Outfit tab is the fifth tab (four tabs right of Species & Body);
+# the cursor starts on the Preset row, the Top row is one down; Hat is 13 rows below Top (Top colour, Print, Print colour,
+# Hood, Outer, Outer colour, Bottom, Bottom colour, Legwear, Legwear colour, Shoes, Shoe colour, Hat); Glasses is two below
+# Hat (Hat colour). A new choice is found by letters (START) and worn with A, and the preview shows it (shot after each).
+scene CREATOR -1
+expect-scene CREATOR
+wait 30
+press R
+wait 4
+press R
+wait 4
+press R
+wait 4
+press R
+wait 12
